OL,3,GNEWSASchool hopes padel can make PE
OL,4,Amore accessible
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school has introduced padel
OL,7,Flessons for pupils in a bid to harness
OL,8,Fthe popularity of the UK's fastest
OL,9,Fgrowing sport and encourage more
OL,10,Fchildren to be active.
OL,12,FMoor Allerton Hall Primary School, in
OL,13,FLeeds, took part in a week-long trial
OL,14,Frun by School Padel, learning to play a
OL,15,Fversion of the game that does not
OL,16,Frequire a specialist court.
OL,18,FMore than 400 pupils took part, with
OL,19,Fteachers at the school now being
OL,20,Ftrained up to help keep the sport going
OL,21,Fthrough PE lessons and after school
OL,22,Fclubs
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
