OL,3,GNEWSASchool hopes padel can make PE
OL,4,Amore accessible
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan Wadsworth from School Padel said
OL,7,Fhe believed the sport could be a "game
OL,8,Fchanger" in getting children active.
